              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This Thai inspired flavor makes a very EASY, yet impressive dish. My family asks for it weekly since their first taste &amp; I have picky eaters! I've served it with rice &amp; broccoli (I've also chopped it &amp; stirred it all together for a single dish). It's also a good dish for company."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "dannyhernanny"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I found this last minute &amp; didn't realize until I started that it was meant to be marinated for a time as well as grilled. I had nothing else for dinner so I went ahead. I put it in the oven instead of grilling. It turned out amazing. The flavors were strong, next time I might just marinate for an hour or 2.",
            "datePublished": "2011-07-07T03:08:49.213Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
