            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "marmotsm"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was ok. I wouldn't say stupendous. I marinated (using low sodium soy sauce) for two hours, and that was plenty salty...probably wouldn't recommend more time. I followed the recipe with the exception of adding a bit of chopped ginger to the marinade. This didn't taste bad, but this isn't a new go-to recipe for me.",
            "datePublished": "2010-12-18T19:00:44.033Z"
          },
          {
